<%# THE ONLY THING AN ACCEPTED SUBMISSION SENDS BACK, and it is deliberately not
    the log. A grammar command or a factual fallback can finish before this
    response reaches the browser, so a pending page here would erase the
    completed turn and strand the input -- see `TurnsController#create` and
    `playthroughs/_turn_log`.

    `replace_all` rather than `replace`, because the ask form and every button
    of the battle panel carry one of these at the same time and all of them are
    now spent. They all get the SAME fresh token: two different buttons pressed
    after this still read as two submissions, because a submission is the token
    and the line together. %>
<%= turbo_stream.replace_all ".request-token" do %>
  <%= render "turns/request_token", token: @request_token %>
<% end %>
